<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">MOMENT / 片刻</view><view class="heading">普通日常，也有闪光。</view><view class="muted">把值得记住的，不止留在相册里。</view><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">本期主题 · OPEN CALL</view><view class="hero-title">收集一束光</view><view class="muted">窗边、树下、回家路上。记录光落下的地方。</view><button bindtap="publish">记录一个片刻</button></view><view class="section">片刻广场</view><input value="{{q}}" bindinput="input" bindconfirm="search" placeholder="搜索文字、标题或创作者" confirm-type="search"/><view class="row"><picker mode="date" value="{{from}}" data-key="from" bindchange="date">{{from||'开始日期'}}</picker><picker mode="date" value="{{to}}" data-key="to" bindchange="date">{{to||'结束日期'}}</picker></view><view class="tags"><text class="chip" bindtap="clear">全部 / 重置</text><text class="chip" wx:for="{{tags}}" wx:key="name" data-tag="{{item.name}}" bindtap="tag"># {{item.name}}</text></view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}" bindtap="load">{{error}} · 点击重试</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="detail"><image wx:if="{{item.media.length && item.media[0].type==='image'}}" class="cover" src="{{item.media[0].url}}" mode="aspectFill"/><video wx:elif="{{item.media.length}}" class="cover" src="{{item.media[0].url}}" controls/><view wx:else class="text-art">{{item.title}}</view><view class="card-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="body">{{item.body}}</view><view class="tags"><text class="chip" wx:for="{{item.tags}}" wx:for-item="t" wx:key="*this"># {{t}}</text></view><view class="meta"><text>{{item.author}} · {{item.date}}</text><text>★ {{item.average}} · {{item.commentCount}} 条回应</text></view></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!items.length&&!loading&&!error}}">这里还没有片刻，换个筛选试试。</view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在寻找片刻…</view></view>
